The '''Pole (1st Form)''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Despite it being {{Legendary}} rarity, it is outclassed by almost all other swords of its rarity, worse than even most {{Rare}} swords, and comparable to {{Uncommon}} swords at best.

It has extremely slow attacks, with subpar range and endlag. It is often only used to obtain [[Pole (2nd Form)]].

==Obtainment==
The Pole (1st Form) can be obtained with a 6% chance after defeating [[Thunder God]], who is located at the [[Upper Skylands]] in the [[First Sea]].

