==Trivia==
* The Pole (1st Form) can be upgraded to its second form [[Pole (2nd Form)]] by getting struck by a lightning in [[Rough Sea]] while holding Pole (1st Form).
* You need at least 180 mastery on Pole (1st Form) to get [[Pole (2nd Form)]].
* The inventory description states the [[Swords|sword]] is blunt, but due to the revamped model, it appears sharp, like a spear.

